          ],
          "fallback": "web",
          "rules": "database: asks for a figure, a count, a total or a ranking that would be looked up in this company's own records — customers, invoices, tracks, albums, genres.\nweb: asks about anything outside this company — a release, a project, a person, a news item, a fact that lives on the open web.\n\nRoute on where the answer lives, never on how the question is phrased. \"How many\" is a database question when the thing being counted is ours and a web question when it is not."
